+/// warning
+
+Be careful when re-raising or returning a `RequestValidationError` with the received `body`. The body may contain sensitive information, so don't include it as is in the response, unless you are sure it's safe to do so for your use case.
+
+For example, avoid returning `exc.body` or a string built from it directly to clients, and instead only include the information that is needed, like the validation `errors`.
+
+///
